    "type": "game",
    "name": "Midnight Riff",
    "steam_appid": 3647600,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join The Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647600/extras/4c52bbd99d1db3c258c96c1667bfba75.avif?t=1750608659\" width=640 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to join the community or want the game to improve, the best way to do that is to join the official Discord! <strong>You can join Discord via the link on the Steam store page.</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647600/extras/baca174e39fdfe2208bcade978c57769.poster.avif?t=1750608659\" width=800 height=109 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647600/extras/baca174e39fdfe2208bcade978c57769.webm?t=1750608659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark into Midnight Riff a casual rhythm adventure where you have to keep up and jam out to face the creatures that you meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a unique battle system incorporating dynamic, looped charts that allow the player to add notes that can defeat your enemies or lead to your own doom. Made for rhythm game regulars and roguelike enjoyers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Releasing soon for free!</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jam out and place your own notes on the chart</strong> to outplay the creatures that impede your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect powerful relics</strong> to aid your journey and turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing maps</strong> every playthrough to allow endless replayability.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647600/extras/baca174e39fdfe2208bcade978c57769.poster.avif?t=1750608659\" width=800 height=109 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647600/extras/baca174e39fdfe2208bcade978c57769.webm?t=1750608659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark into Midnight Riff a casual rhythm adventure where you have to keep up and jam out to face the creatures that you meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a unique battle system incorporating dynamic, looped charts that allow the player to add notes that can defeat your enemies or lead to your own doom. Made for rhythm game regulars and roguelike enjoyers alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Releasing soon for free!</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jam out and place your own notes on the chart</strong> to outplay the creatures that impede your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect powerful relics</strong> to aid your journey and turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Changing maps</strong> every playthrough to allow endless replayability.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Unlike anything seen before, Midnight Riff is a true rhythm roguelike. Vibe to the rhythm and jam out to deal damage and win battles with the unique active-time rhythm battle system. Can you become the rhythm of the night?",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
